WEBVTT

00:13:00.162 --> 00:13:03.829
I have never thought that ideas are rare.

00:13:04.621 --> 00:13:07.246
And, you know, if that
idea isn't any good,

00:13:07.246 --> 00:13:09.537
then there is another that's
going to be better.

00:13:10.787 --> 00:13:16.162
And I think that is probably generally
true, but not generally acknowledged.

00:13:16.537 --> 00:13:22.287
So that for people to give up on an
idea may in many cases lead to

00:13:22.287 --> 00:13:25.829
a sort of panic. If I don't have
that idea, then what do I have?

00:13:26.162 --> 00:13:28.787
Who am I if I don't have that idea?

00:13:29.079 --> 00:13:34.287
So being less identified with your ideas
is also associated, I think,